comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-02T06:33:46.098Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: complete all-status corpus 2850/2850 with no unreadable records; live exact keyword Axios finds only the discovery comment on pm-gh1364, include-dev-deps and GHSA-c29m-xwm3-cm6r find no canonical work. All twelve GHSA identifiers were checked in the initial all-status intake. Full live pm-qwoy, pm-cbzvgn and pm-7wmq metadata were read; parent history verifies. Closed pm-cbzvgn fixed distinct brace-expansion advisories and is preserved as completed historical work. This new Axios/CodSpeed report is recorded before PR1372 merge to keep discovery evidence reviewed. Remediation is open and unclaimed; it is not included in PR1372 source-fix closure or represented as security clearance."
  "2026-10-02T10:31:07.233Z","harness:codex","Planning correction: the mandatory active-item context gate identified this newly recorded open intake as missing estimated_minutes. Add a preliminary 240-minute estimate covering external-version remediation, inspection/replacement of both embedded bundles and source maps, dev-inclusive admission with negative controls, and review/verification. This is a planning estimate with implementation uncertainty, not time spent or proof of remediation. The item remains open and unclaimed while PR1372 is finished first; all documented scanner findings remain unresolved."
  "2026-10-02T16:39:24.811Z","harness:codex","Live intake 2026-10-02: complete strict all-status corpus 2851/2851 with no omissions or unreadable records; no in-progress items or open GitHub PRs. pnpm full audit reproduces 7 high/5 moderate Axios findings and native Scorecard alert29 remains open at current main. This delivery actively implements CodSpeed external/embedded dependency remediation and mandatory dev-inclusive admission together with linked-test monorepo snapshot dependency preservation under pm-5iwfkj in one reviewed PR. Prior completed brace-expansion work stays closed. No alert will be dismissed to simulate remediation."
  "2026-10-02T16:59:31.480Z","harness:codex","Pre-edit test audit: admission uses the actual installed CodSpeed package plus real temporary copies; stale CJS, ESM, map, native, missing-file and package-upgrade controls must fail. A separate loopback-server integration will exercise the public runtime with both entrypoints and audited transport. No security policy skip or scanner dismissal is introduced. The independent boundary investigation found only axios and FormData cross the removed embedded-dependency section; both remain supplied by audited declared runtime dependencies."
  "2026-10-02T17:10:53.023Z","harness:codex","Independent candidate review found and reproduced a compatibility defect: using external Axios default instances shares application response interceptors, unlike the original embedded clients. Both original entries passed the loopback setup response, while both candidate entries threw ApiError with undefined status after an application response.data interceptor. The candidate will use a dedicated client and retain CancelToken. The same review independently confirmed every retained mapping coordinate and name, untouched native payload, exact plugin resolution and a zero-advisory full audit."
  "2026-10-02T17:29:30.225Z","harness:codex","Independent candidate review found shared default Axios interceptors could transform instrumentation responses. Both CJS and ESM real loopback regressions failed before the corrective patch (ApiError status undefined), then the patch was changed to dedicated axios.create clients with CancelToken retained. Native payloads remain byte-identical; all retained source map coordinates and names are preserved. Required full-suite regressions additionally enforce the complete audit command and Windows snapshot workflow. No production exploit is established."
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-02T06:37:50.731Z","harness:codex","Scope and evidence boundary: this intake documents an unresolved development-tool dependency report before merging PR1372. It is not a regression introduced by the scoped recovery, continuation or semantic-preview fixes. Production-only audit is clean. Full audit and native Scorecard remain open; embedded Axios requires separate inspection beyond pnpm lock resolution. Do not dismiss the scanner alert or report security clearance until remediation and native merged-main scans are verified."
